## Personal Shortcuts

# Quick commands I use frequently:
# - Run only unit tests in watch mode: npm run test:watch
# - Run integration tests (spins up Testcontainers): npm run test:integration
# - Open Drizzle Studio to inspect the dev database: npm run db:studio

